    <h1>UniverseDaily</h1>
    <p class="landing-hero__lead">A daily curation app that gathers the cosmos that NASA, ESA, NOAA, and ESO openly publish each day, and lays it out so casual viewers can browse it without friction. Today's Sun and Moon, 30+ Solar System bodies as interactive 3D models, and tonight's sky at your location — all in one screen.</p>
